	(2012, 1112, 'postharvest hortgro co za pag south african controlled atmosphere storage operators manual', 'https://postharvest.hortgro.co.za/pag/south-african-controlled-atmosphere-storage-operators-manual/', NULL, 'Fruitlet analysis samples on apples are conducted around 62 days DAFB. These results can be used to determine the number of calcium sprays per orchard. Granny Smith which is not as susceptible to bitter pit and which has a long storage life, is usually given six calcium sprays whereas Golden...'),
	(2013, 1112, 'apal org au precision fertigation to improve productivity', 'https://apal.org.au/precision-fertigation-to-improve-productivity/', NULL, '| **N15 trial (2014  2015).** | TIA Horticulture Centre, UTAS Sandy Bay Campus | Jonogold on M26 rootstock | Nitrogen (N) supplied as Ca(NO3)2 enriched with 5% N15a) Pre-harvest application (24g N/tree @5% N15)b) post-harvest application (24g N/tree@5% N15)c) Control (zero N15) |'),
